Package: iPCSF
Title: Improved Prize-Collecting Steiner Forest with Modern Network Visualization
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Julia", "Verheul-Campos",
    email = "verheuljulia@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = ""))
Description: An enhanced implementation of the Prize-Collecting Steiner Forest 
    (PCSF) algorithm for biological network analysis. Automatically downloads 
    protein interaction networks from the STRING database for any supported 
    organism, performs functional enrichment analysis (GO and KEGG), and 
    generates modern interactive HTML network visualizations with cluster 
    annotation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
